  "paraphrase": "For all functions y from real numbers to real numbers, where y is defined as y(x) = 2x⁴ + 7x³ + 3x - 5, and for any finite set S of real numbers, if the set of points { (x, y(x)) | x ∈ S } is collinear, then the average of the elements in S is equal to putnam_1977_a1_solution."
